{"id":"n72120-1-10","stage":1,"title":"청소년 · 青少年","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72120-1-10-1","ko":"세계 청소년 축구 대회에서 저희가 우승을 했습니다.","zh":"我们在世界青少年足球比赛中夺冠了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세계","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청소년","meaning":"青少年","explanation":"청소년：青少年","readings":[{"term":"청소년","audio":"/audio/484d1e4823fbd3e18388.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72120","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대회에서","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희가","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"1","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우승을","meaning":"冠军，第一名","explanation":"우승：冠军，第一名；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우승","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69495","senseId":"1","lemma":"우승","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했습니다.","meaning":"获得，取得","explanation":"하다：获得，取得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"地球上的所有国家。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"id":"484d1e4823fbd3e1","term":"청소년","zh":"青少年","audio":"/audio/484d1e4823fbd3e18388.mp3","entryId":"72120","definition":"还没有成年的，年龄为十几岁的人。","pronunciation":["청소년"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"31e52393f3eb0c17","term":"우승","zh":"冠军，第一名","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3","entryId":"69495","definition":"在比赛中全部战胜对方，获得第一。","pronunciation":["우승"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"获得，取得","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"实现某种结果。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac2a60e2e682f2116622.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72120-1-10-2","ko":"우리나라 축구의 미래가 희망차 보이는군요!","zh":"我们国家的足球未来看起来充满希望啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라","meaning":"我们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们；나라：国，国家","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구의","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미래가","meaning":"未来，将来","explanation":"미래：未来，将来；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"미래","audio":"/audio/44779ffe007a1d51faa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61518","senseId":"1","lemma":"미래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"희망차","meaning":"充满希望，满怀希望","explanation":"희망차다：充满希望，满怀希望；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"희망차다","audio":"/audio/f853fdd1cc212513a686.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88208","senseId":"1","lemma":"희망차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이는군요!","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"44779ffe007a1d51","term":"미래","zh":"未来，将来","audio":"/audio/44779ffe007a1d51faa7.mp3","entryId":"61518","definition":"即将到来的时候。","pronunciation":["미ː래"]},{"id":"f853fdd1cc212513","term":"희망차다","zh":"充满希望，满怀希望","audio":"/audio/f853fdd1cc212513a686.mp3","entryId":"88208","definition":"对未来的事情充满期待。","pronunciation":["히망차다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/440970c773d8e0264223.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.693,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72120","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequen